Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after 10,000 years in exile,\Nthe mighty Leviathan is ready to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to reach his full potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,there are several souls\Nthat must still be offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, on to phase two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Each glimmer of light\Nmust join to become whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Each soul must be utilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then can the Leviathan cross over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient soldiers of the\NOrychalcos, hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Locate the scattered pieces\Nof the Great Leviathan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,for the Battle of Atlantis begins again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Orychalcos soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Scatter your forces to the\Nfar corners of the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:01:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and deliver to me all\Nthe souls you can gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.37,0:01:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Valon. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh's friends are\Nheading your way. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.07,0:01:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's time for me to\Nshow Joey Wheeler who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.09,0:01:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And there he goes! Hey! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for your thoughts, and\NI'm not leaving without Yugi and Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing the wrong shoes for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, stop! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Joey? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should start running again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.91,0:02:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:02:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever hear of looking both ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.85,0:03:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never outrun this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one that took mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you are, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time to chase him down and save mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's riding right into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on you like stink on an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away that easily. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.09,0:04:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Very funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you want a little\Nmore, do you? Well, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are those two already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We were worried about you\Ntwo for a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that we know who we're after,\Nit's time to crash their little party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we better act fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.09,0:05:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Joey ran off to find\Nthese Pegasus guys on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.87,0:05:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get there before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He better not screw this up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've got bigger problems, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, those same monsters we saw\Nin the desert are roaming the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We can all jump in my car. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid things are even\Nworse than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do these creatures want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the evening news,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,thousands of people around the\Nworld are suddenly collapsing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,in the streets and falling into\Na state of unconsciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be using the power of the\NOrikalkos to capture people's souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear so. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and did I mention that every police officer\Nin this town is under their spell, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have to battle these monsters\Non our own and make our way to darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless he finds us first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.39,0:07:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting, my soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We must continue to collect\Nthe souls of man and beast
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,until we have amassed enough\Npower to rebuild Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're his\Nbabysitter, so where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.27,0:07:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,One of your little pals forced him into a\Ngame of cat and mouse, and now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Valon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who got Joey into\Nthis mess in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing he needs right now is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are, old chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get down to business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, pal, I want my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.37,0:08:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why chase me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She happens to have a\Nmind of her own, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,At least...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She did before you guys brainwashed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No one was brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She chose to join our side\Nwith her own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And you want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She was sick of taking a back\Nseat while you got all the fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I stepped in and changed all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed with her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.97,0:08:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She was one of my best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But the last time I saw her, she was saying\Nthings that mine never would have said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sick of my life,\Nso I chose to change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never been an outsider like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got your little group\Nand I'm not part of it. Wake up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler I led you here\Nto get rid of you for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,good Cause Mai can't be\Nhappy with you around Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a constant reminder\Nof what her life used
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to be And Mai wants to\Nforget all that But as long
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,as you still exist in\Nthis world She'll never be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,able to forget So I'm\Nhere to erase you for good
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus I know that deep\Ndown Mai still loves you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have ourselves a duel or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm giving you much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I never back down from a challenge,\Nespecially when I'm fighting for a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon alligator sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about\Nthis guy's dueling style.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.95,0:10:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice opening card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you,\Nmine is better, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my good friend, Psychic Armahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Psycho Armah, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just summon a monster that has zero\Nattack points or am I imagining things?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My psychic armor head doesn't have a\Nsingle attack point, but when I add
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,it together with a few other cards\Nit becomes my very own suit of armor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And here's the piece that'll hold it all\Ntogether, my armored gravitation card
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need a little\Nmore information here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My Tramp Buster armor\Nshould clear things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.27,0:10:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, still lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even dumber than\NI thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Big Bang Blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.23,0:11:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll add my Overboost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, Active Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for the fun part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Armored Gravitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the space suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Each piece of my armor may\Nhave zero attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but together they form\Nan unstoppable force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as I attack, you'll\Nexperience that power for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The time draws near, my pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My Orichalco soldiers are gathering the\Nenergy necessary to fuel your rebirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll cleanse the earth of its\Nimpurities and rebuild paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only one mile from\NParadis headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.87,0:12:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have our company back\Nin no time. Right, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.43,0:12:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with an extremely\Npowerful organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's going to take everything\Nwe have to bring them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.97,0:12:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm officially lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can pretty much\Nforget about finding Joey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.19,0:13:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should get someone\Nelse behind the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.83,0:13:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take whatever you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Celtic Guardians!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You came in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I could have taken him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the only thing\Nthat would have been
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,taken is your soul had\Nwe arrived any later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So those things are working for darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you guys were together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We were,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,until he decided to hop\Non some guy's motorcycle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and take off after one of\NDarts' little flunkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it Valon? Who? Valon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the guy Rebecca and I dueled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only does Valon have\Na thing against Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's got a deck full of\Nmonsters I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find Joey before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That chump's gonna have to wait,\Nbecause we've got bigger problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.93,0:14:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone has a plan, please speak now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponent identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy just summoned\Nfive monsters at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's wearing them like some\Nkind of space-age suit of armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only does my suit defend me, it\Npacks a pretty mean offense, too. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.57,0:14:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little Halloween costume\Ndoesn't have one single attack point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pretty lame offense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with my right arm, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This part of my armor is\Nknown as Big Bang Blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid your little\Nreptile's about to find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to calculate the odds of my success.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,System activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Probability of monster destruction, 99%.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bang Blow, attack alligator sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That metal arm has zero attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this guy thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator sword, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bang Blow automatically\Ndestroys every monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Disintegrate his lizard\Nwith Fist of Armour!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating active guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorbing attack damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You mind telling me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I just lose 1,500 life points?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.33,0:16:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it real simple for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When my right arm activates, it\Ndestroys every monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the total number of attack\Npoints of every monster that was
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,just destroyed gets subtracted from\Neach player's life points. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you lose any points?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of my active guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Its special ability allows my\Nchest plate to absorb all the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.37,0:16:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,damage that would have reduced\Nmy life point so I stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack phase has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Disengage armor matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My armor may be gone, but I\Nhaven't lost a single life point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got plenty more\Nsurprises where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never survive this, duel wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the sloppiest finish I ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you just ended your turn with no\Ncards on the field to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to hide\Nbehind anything, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I win all my duels by\Nfacing my enemy head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lesson I learned\Nthe hard way a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you shall have that end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Take nothing off him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he is, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Valon, you've been in and out of 12\Ndetention centers, but mine's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We have more productive ways of\Ndealing with troubled boys like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Try channeling your energy into these\NDuel Monsters cards instead of your fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What he didn't tell me was he\Nhad friends in high places.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That detention center\Nhad a silent partner who
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.95,0:18:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,showed a great deal of\Ninterest in our dueling skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So how'd you do, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.73,0:18:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have beaten all these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The cards don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to be next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say I like your\Nattitude, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But your talents are being\Nwasted on this secluded island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying I can just walk away\Nfrom here with you and never come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, provided that you work\Nfor my company, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You got yourself a deal, Ponytail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.93,0:18:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch yourself or I\Nmay decide to duel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the day he rescued me from\Nthat dump, I've been working for darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.07,0:19:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But unlike some of my\Nless talented colleagues,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I duel on my own terms,\Njust like I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And today, I'm not fighting for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This selfish punk doesn't know the\Nfirst thing about Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is about way more\Nthan just winning for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about fighting for\Nthe people you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.19,0:19:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, hang in there, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to teach you\Na lesson Joey Wheeler style.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be sorry you\Never messed with my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just getting warmed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see what my\Ndeck of armor can really do!
